st Integration'.\",\"template\":\"Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Develop Integration Components\",\"description\":\"The 'Develop Integration Components' activity focuses on building the necessary components for integration.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Test Integration\",\"description\":\"The 'Test Integration' activity entails testing the integration to ensure it functions correctly.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"A 'Test Integration' activity must be followed by a 'Deploy Integration' activity at some point later in the same process instance. Conversely, a 'Deploy Integration' event can occur only if a 'Test Integration' event has occurred before it within the same process instance. This bidirectional and ordered dependency ensures that 'Test Integration' impose obligations for future 'Deploy Integration', and 'Deploy Integration' cannot occur without prior 'Test Integration'. Multiple 'Test Integration' and 'Deploy Integration' are allowed, with each 'Test Integration' eventually leading to a 'Deploy Integration' and each 'Deploy Integration' being justified by a preceding 'Test Integration'.\",\"template\":\"Succession\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Test Integration\",\"description\":\"The 'Test Integration' activity entails testing the integration to ensure it functions correctly.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Deploy Integration\",\"description\":\"The 'Deploy Integration' activity is responsible for deploying the integration into the production environment.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"Whenever a 'Deploy Integration' activity occurs, it must be immediately followed by a 'Monitor System Performance' activity in the next event position, with no other events in between. This immediate succession ensures a direct and uninterrupted transition from 'Deploy Integration' to 'Monitor System Performance'. Multiple 'Deploy Integration'-'Monitor System Performance' pairs can exist in a process instance, each adhering to this immediate succession rule. Events of 'Monitor System Performance' can occur elsewhere in the process but not between a 'Deploy Integration' and its corresponding 'Monitor System Performance'.\",\"template\":\"Chain Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Deploy Integration\",\"description\":\"The 'Deploy Integration' activity is responsible for deploying the integration into the production environment.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Monitor System Performance\",\"description\":\"The 'Monitor System Performance' activity involves ongoing monitoring of the system's performance post-integration.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If a 'Monitor System Performance' activity occurs, then a 'Resolve Integration Issues' activity must occur after that 'Monitor System Performance' event and before any subsequent 'Monitor System Performance' occurs no other occurrence of 'Monitor System Performance' is allowed between a 'Monitor System Performance' and its corresponding 'Resolve Integration Issues'. This ensures that each 'Monitor System Performance' is individually responded to by a 'Resolve Integration Issues' in sequence.\",\"template\":\"Alternate Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Monitor System Performance\",\"description\":\"The 'Monitor System Performance' activity involves ongoing monitoring of the system's performance post-integration.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Resolve Integration Issues\",\"description\":\"The 'Resolve Integration Issues' activity deals with identifying and fixing any issues that arise during integration.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If 'Plan Integration' activity occurs in a process instance, then 'Document Integration Process' activity must also occur at least once within the same process instance, either before or after the 'Plan Integration' event. If 'Plan Integration' does not occur, there is no requirement for 'Document Integration Process' to occur. Multiple occurrences of 'Plan Integration' are satisfied by at least one occurrence of 'Document Integration Process', and multiple 'Document Integration Process' instances are allowed.\",\"template\":\"Responded Existence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Plan Integration\",\"description\":\"The 'Plan Integration' activity represents the initial planning phase for the integration project.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Document Integration Process\",\"description\":\"The 'Document Integration Process' activity includes documenting all aspects of the integration process.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If 'Train Users' activity occurs, then 'Deploy Integration' must also occur in the same process instance, and vice versa. This mutual obligation ensures that neither event can occur without the other. The events can occur multiple times and in any order relative to each other. If neither event occurs, the constraint is still considered satisfied.\",\"template\":\"Co-Existence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Train Users\",\"description\":\"The 'Train Users' activity provides training to users on the new integrated system.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Deploy Integration\",\"description\":\"The 'Deploy Integration' activity is responsible for deploying the integration into the production environment.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"A 'Review Integration Plan' activity cannot be immediately followed by a 'Approve Integration Design' activity; there must be at least one other event between them. Similarly, a 'Approve Integration Design' event cannot be immediately preceded by a 'Review Integration Plan' event. This constraint allows multiple occurrences of 'Review Integration Plan' and 'Approve Integration Design' in any order, provided they are not adjacent in the event sequence.\",\"template\":\"Not Chain Succession\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Review Integration Plan\",\"description\":\"The 'Review Integration Plan' activity is for reviewing the integration plan for accuracy and completeness.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Approve Integration Design\",\"description\":\"The 'Approve Integration Design' activity involves approving the designed integration architecture.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"A 'Validate Integration Results' activity cannot be preceded by a 'Approve Integration Design' within the same process instance. If a 'Approve Integration Design' event has occurred at any point before a 'Validate Integration Results' event, then 'Validate Integration Results' is disallowed. Multiple instances of 'Validate Integration Results' and 'Approve Integration Design' can occur, but all instances of 'Validate Integration Results' must occur before any instance of 'Approve Integration Design'.\",\"template\":\"Not Precedence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Validate Integration Results\",\"description\":\"The 'Validate Integration Results' activity validates the outcomes of the integration tests and deployment.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Approve Integration Design\",\"description\":\"The 'Approve Integration Design' activity involves approving the designed integration architecture.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"The 'Update System Documentation' activity must not be followed 