ion' or 'Deploy Integration' must occur in the process instance. This means that the process is compliant if only 'Test Integration' event occurs without any occurrence of 'Deploy Integration' event, or only 'Deploy Integration' occurs without any occurrence of 'Test Integration'. The process is non-compliant if both 'Test Integration' and 'Deploy Integration' occur, or if neither occurs. The constraint enforces a mutual exclusivity and a mandatory occurrence of one of the specified activities.\",\"template\":\"Exclusive Choice\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Test Integration\",\"description\":\"The 'Test Integration' activity entails testing the integration to ensure it functions correctly.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Deploy Integration\",\"description\":\"The 'Deploy Integration' activity is responsible for deploying the integration into the production environment.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If a 'Deploy Integration' activity occurs with the condition that 'Integration Status is Failed,' then a 'Resolve Integration Issues' activity must eventually occur after the 'Deploy Integration' event within 0 to 24 hours.\",\"template\":\"Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Deploy Integration\",\"description\":\"The 'Deploy Integration' activity is responsible for deploying the integration into the production environment.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Resolve Integration Issues\",\"description\":\"The 'Resolve Integration Issues' activity deals with identifying and fixing any issues that arise during integration.\"},\"activation_condition\":\"A.Integration Status is Failed\",\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":\"0,24,h\",\"cardinality\":null}]}"